  "body": "Extend `crates/motion/src/multiaxis/rotary_flow.rs` beyond single two-chain bands.\n\nWhat to build:\n- Interpolate consecutive flow bands across 3 or more ordered guide edge chains `(C_0..C_1, C_1..C_2, ...)` without duplicate boundary passes.\n- Support a single helical guide edge chain (`C_0` morphed to `C_0 + 2 * pi` in `theta`) to cover a full cylindrical revolution for single-start screws and augers.\n- Refuse crossing, non-monotonic, or degenerate chain sets by name.\n\nDepends on #2824 (`rotary_flow` motion kernel) and #2826 (`OpType::RotaryFlow` app wiring).\n\nDone means: `Rotary Flow` generates full-coverage, gouge-free toolpaths from a single helical edge chain and from 3+ ordered chains on helical screw fixtures in `crates/motion` and `crates/app` tests, and refuses crossing chains by name.\n\nPart of #2804\n",
